---
title: 猫又が襲撃されると猫又と襲撃した狼が両方死亡する (道連れ)
setup: { nekomata: 1, werewolf: 1, villager: 2 }
rules:
  general.first-victim: none
---
# 1夜: Bob (狼) が Alice (猫又) を襲撃 → engine が curse-on-killed trait を発動し、
# 猫又本体と襲撃した狼を両方 kill (night_kill 2 件 emit)。
# Day 1 で Dave 処刑 (Night 1 まで進めるため)、 Day 2 投票で終局 (検証対象外)。

++Alice、Bob、Carol、Dave
!Alice=猫又
!Bob=人狼
!Carol=村人
!Dave=村人
!Bob 1夜 襲撃 Alice

# == engine: Night 0 ==
# peace (襲撃が attack-immune で無効)
# == end ==

Alice→Dave
Bob→Dave
Carol→Dave
Dave→Alice

# == engine: Day 1 ==
# vote tally: Dave 3 / Alice 1 → execution=Dave
# == end ==
# == engine: Night 1 ==
# night_kill: Alice
# night_kill: Bob
# == end ==

Day 2:

Carol→Carol

# == engine: Final ==
# result: villager_won
# survivors: Carol
# == end ==

# @expect-status Alice: dead
# @expect-status Bob: dead
# @expect-event night_kill target:Alice
# @expect-event night_kill target:Bob
